Coach, I often hear you talk
about your wife.

2066
01:50:58,590 --> 01:51:00,130
It's been years since she passed.

2067
01:51:00,210 --> 01:51:01,630
Do you still miss her?

2068
01:51:03,710 --> 01:51:06,500
As days go by, I miss her more.

2069
01:51:07,540 --> 01:51:09,420
I was an alcoholic.

2070
01:51:09,840 --> 01:51:11,590
It was she who turned me
into an honest man.

2071
01:51:11,710 --> 01:51:14,670
She took me to her father
and made me train in wrestling.

2072
01:51:14,790 --> 01:51:16,460
And one day we got married.

2073
01:51:17,210 --> 01:51:18,460
It was her all along.

2074
01:51:19,630 --> 01:51:21,090
We can even remain a beggar.

2075
01:51:21,340 --> 01:51:23,720
But we should not remain alone

2076
01:51:24,290 --> 01:51:26,460
without a wife during our last days.

2077
01:51:29,380 --> 01:51:31,380
Didn't you ever fight with your wife?

2078
01:51:32,840 --> 01:51:37,300
There's no room for fights when there are
no expectations in a relationship.

2079
01:51:38,170 --> 01:51:42,960
When there are expectations involved, 
that'll attract fights.

2080
01:51:43,380 --> 01:51:45,300
And that, my boy, 
we call husband and wife fights.

2081
01:51:45,540 --> 01:51:48,670
There was not one day we did not fight.
We fought like mad.

2082
01:51:49,750 --> 01:51:52,130
The moment you marry your wife, 

2083
01:51:52,340 --> 01:51:56,220
She becomes the undisputed queen
of the family.

2084
01:51:56,670 --> 01:51:58,130
She makes the decisions!

2085
01:51:58,250 --> 01:52:00,830
Only executing them is a husband's job.

2086
01:52:01,420 --> 01:52:03,130
If you understand this fact, 

2087
01:52:03,290 --> 01:52:05,080
there will be no problems in marriage.

2088
01:52:05,630 --> 01:52:06,670
I don't get it, coach!

2089
01:52:06,960 --> 01:52:10,960
A few families still fight
despite dancing to their wife's tunes.

2090
01:52:12,040 --> 01:52:15,170
In every marriage, 
until they get to know each other

2091
01:52:15,290 --> 01:52:18,080
for the first ten-fifteen years, 
they will tend to fight.

2092
01:52:19,000 --> 01:52:21,080
Does it get resolved after fifteen years?

2093
01:52:22,250 --> 01:52:23,460
It won't resolve right away.

2094
01:52:23,540 --> 01:52:25,500
Similar to the continuous drizzle
after heavy rain.

2095
01:52:25,670 --> 01:52:29,340
Seven to eight years later, 
there will be small unresolved disputes.

2096
01:52:29,420 --> 01:52:30,960
Would it get any better after that?

2097
01:52:31,670 --> 01:52:34,840
After that, 
both will be fifty-sixty years old.

2098
01:52:35,000 --> 01:52:37,710
Both won't have the strength to fight.

2099
01:52:38,210 --> 01:52:39,960
That period of our life

2100
01:52:40,210 --> 01:52:41,840
will be the most peaceful.

2101
01:52:49,880 --> 01:52:52,210
How does it matter if you lead a life
after you're sixty?

2102
01:52:52,500 --> 01:52:53,830
He pegs himself to be Shakespeare.

2103
01:52:54,040 --> 01:52:55,580
Churning out philosophy.

2104
01:52:55,920 --> 01:52:57,380
And you're listening to him.

2105
01:53:13,130 --> 01:53:14,090
Auntie, is uncle home?

2106
01:53:15,590 --> 01:53:16,470
He went out.

2107
01:53:16,840 --> 01:53:17,840
He'll be back soon. Sit down.

2108
01:53:25,670 --> 01:53:26,880
Is the competition tomorrow, Veera?

2109
01:53:27,590 --> 01:53:28,840
Yes, auntie. It's tomorrow.

2110
01:53:29,290 --> 01:53:30,580
How was the training?

2111
01:53:31,090 --> 01:53:33,670
Don't even ask.
They squeezed the life out of me.

2112
01:53:34,090 --> 01:53:35,970
The coach never lets me rest.

2113
01:53:36,210 --> 01:53:39,790
Heavy workout! I'm still not able
to move my hands and legs.

2114
01:53:40,340 --> 01:53:42,470
No matter how much you train, 
you can't win against her.

2115
01:53:42,880 --> 01:53:44,550
Why are you toiling yourself?

2116
01:53:44,920 --> 01:53:46,750
You could've appeared straight
to the match.

2117
01:53:47,460 --> 01:53:49,540
Auntie, you've decided that I will lose.

2118
01:53:52,130 --> 01:53:54,630
The moment you decided
to compete with your wife, 

2119
01:53:55,000 --> 01:53:55,880
you lost the match!

2120
01:53:58,210 --> 01:53:59,790
Your uncle is a fool.

2121
01:54:00,090 --> 01:54:01,670
But you're a bigger fool than him.

2122
01:54:02,170 --> 01:54:05,210
Would anyone in this world be ready
to compete with his wife?

2123
01:54:07,130 --> 01:54:11,300
Men like you want your women
to abide by you.

2124
01:54:11,670 --> 01:54:12,590
Am I right?

2125
01:54:13,960 --> 01:54:15,000
Tell me something.

2126
01:54:15,540 --> 01:54:17,120
Would you be able to live without women?

2127
01:54:17,540 --> 01:54:19,710
You need a woman your entire life.

2128
01:54:20,460 --> 01:54:22,170
Mother, until you get married.

2129
01:54:22,630 --> 01:54:24,590
After marriage, it's your wife.

2130
01:54:26,710 --> 01:54:27,670
You may ask, 

2131
01:54:28,630 --> 01:54:30,010
could women live without men?

2132
01:54:31,170 --> 01:54:34,880
Many women have raised
their children being single.

2133
01:54:35,460 --> 01:54:38,130
But men tend to remarry immediately.

2134
01:54:38,540 --> 01:54:41,210
Their excuse would be
for the sake of children.

2135
01:54:41,750 --> 01:54:43,420
It's his children too.

2136
01:54:43,790 --> 01:54:44,960
Why can't he take care of them?

2137
01:54:45,340 --> 01:54:46,380
He won't!

2138
01:54:46,630 --> 01:54:48,380
Because he does not know how to.

2139
01:54:49,960 --> 01:54:51,590
Do you know what the purpose
of marriage is?

2140
01:54:52,040 --> 01:54:53,670
Men are opportunists!

2141
01:54:54,250 --> 01:54:55,710
They are self-centered.

2142
01:54:56,040 --> 01:55:00,460
To change that trait, 
God gets them married to a woman.

2143
01:55:00,790 --> 01:55:02,170
A woman enters a man's life, 

2144
01:55:02,380 --> 01:55:03,300
and children are born.

2145
01:55:03,420 --> 01:55:05,000
Now he lives for them.

2146
01:55:05,420 --> 01:55:06,550
It may be a burden for him.

2147
01:55:06,750 --> 01:55:08,170
But even if he can't bear it, 

2148
01:55:08,630 --> 01:55:10,510
there's meaning to his life.

2149
01:55:11,790 --> 01:55:16,120
Listen, I knew that your wife was a
wrestler right from the beginning.

2150
01:55:31,210 --> 01:55:32,960
Auntie, 
why didn't you tell me this sooner?

2151
01:55:33,090 --> 01:55:34,880
Had I told you, this marriage
wouldn't have happened.

2152
01:55:35,460 --> 01:55:37,290
I thought if a girl like Keerthi
is in your life, 

2153
01:55:37,590 --> 01:55:39,920
she would change you and your way of life.

2154
01:55:40,170 --> 01:55:41,300
That is why I did not say.

2155
01:55:42,170 --> 01:55:44,840
Veera, one day, 
when you were not home, 

2156
01:55:45,040 --> 01:55:46,460
I took Keerthi to the temple.

2157
01:55:46,790 --> 01:55:48,290
Have you forgotten wrestling?

2158
01:55:50,090 --> 01:55:53,760
They say anything you do for 48 days
becomes a habit.

2159
01:55:54,500 --> 01:55:56,790
For fifteen years, 
I only thought about wrestling.

2160
01:55:57,670 --> 01:55:58,840
I cannot forget it.

2161
01:55:59,250 --> 01:56:00,960
Then what made you choose this life?

2162
01:56:03,630 --> 01:56:05,380
We all are slaves of our family.

2163
01:56:06,090 --> 01:56:08,300
When the choice is between
family and career, 

2164
01:56:08,500 --> 01:56:10,000
we can only choose family.

2165
01:56:10,590 --> 01:56:11,470
It's true!

2166
01:56:11,750 --> 01:56:13,460
But people who are determined
to make it big

2167
01:56:13,630 --> 01:56:15,380
should not consider family.

2168
01:56:15,750 --> 01:56:18,130
You should turn a deaf ear
and continue to pursue your dream.

2169
01:56:19,040 --> 01:56:20,170
It's easier said than done.

2170
01:56:21,460 --> 01:56:26,130
Players from other countries
have to compete only with their opponents.

2171
01:56:26,710 --> 01:56:27,960
But in India, 

2172
01:56:28,340 --> 01:56:30,220
first, you need to compete
with the family and win.

2173
01:56:30,790 --> 01:56:32,540
You'll be half tired.

2174
01:56:33,090 --> 01:56:35,630
After that, we won't have the energy
to compete with the opponents.

2175
01:56:36,210 --> 01:56:37,750
Do you like this life?

2176
01:56:40,380 --> 01:56:41,510
I like him very much.

2177
01:56:43,040 --> 01:56:44,170
Look, Veera, 

2178
01:56:45,210 --> 01:56:47,380
you're lucky to have Keerthi
as your wife.

2179
01:56:48,090 --> 01:56:49,720
Please try to make it work.

2180
01:56:50,000 --> 01:56:51,750
Instead, if you listen to your uncle, 

2181
01:56:51,960 --> 01:56:53,540
you'll be out on the streets in despair.

2182
01:56:54,960 --> 01:56:56,380
I can't believe you speak so much.

2183
01:56:57,040 --> 01:56:58,500
Do you know how far I have studied?

2184
01:56:58,750 --> 01:56:59,750
Fourth grade, right?

2185
01:57:00,210 --> 01:57:01,750
I graduated with a BA
in English Literature.

2186
01:57:03,710 --> 01:57:06,090
Even my father lied
and got me married to your uncle.

2187
01:57:09,040 --> 01:57:09,960
The match is tomorrow.

2188
01:57:10,960 --> 01:57:12,880
We'll see who wins. Kerala or Tamil Nadu?

2189
01:57:14,040 --> 01:57:14,920
I'll hang up.

2190
01:57:16,210 --> 01:57:17,710
Son, when did you arrive?

2191
01:57:18,170 --> 01:57:19,050
Just now.

2192
01:57:19,130 --> 01:57:20,550
Did she ask you for a cup of coffee?

2193
01:57:20,630 --> 01:57:21,880
I'm good. I'm leaving.

2194
01:57:22,130 --> 01:57:23,550
What? What were you doing?

2195
01:57:24,090 --> 01:57:25,170
I was talking to him.

2196
01:57:25,590 --> 01:57:28,010
As if you're a big shot
discussing current affairs.

2197
01:57:28,500 --> 01:57:30,210
Go! Go and get us coffee!

2198
01:57:30,540 --> 01:57:32,960
Listen! Two coffees. Full strong!

2199
01:57:33,840 --> 01:57:35,970
One, me. One, nephew!

2200
01:57:36,130 --> 01:57:38,920
Nephew coffee, full sugar.
My coffee, no sugar.

2201
01:57:39,170 --> 01:57:41,210
Understood? Go and make coffee.

2202
01:57:41,840 --> 01:57:44,840
I hope you understand
and won't add too much sugar.

2203
01:57:44,960 --> 01:57:46,500
I am already diabetic!

2204
01:57:47,250 --> 01:57:48,250
What is it?

2205
01:57:54,540 --> 01:57:57,420
-Do you like this life?
-I like him very much.

2206
01:57:58,210 --> 01:58:00,500
You're lucky to have Keerthi as your wife.

2207
01:58:01,000 --> 01:58:02,420
Please try to make it work.

2208
01:58:02,710 --> 01:58:05,210
-With this, the over is done.
-Hey, catch the ball.

2209
01:58:07,380 --> 01:58:08,880
Uncle, we'll take the ball.

2210
01:58:10,000 --> 01:58:12,580
Hey, I can't get in. Move the cupboard.

2211
01:58:13,090 --> 01:58:15,670
-Pull it hard.
-Here, move to the side.

2212
01:58:17,960 --> 01:58:19,420
Damn, it's so heavy!

2213
01:58:21,290 --> 01:58:22,170
Oh, no!

2214
01:58:22,380 --> 01:58:24,130
Hey, why are you making so much noise?

2215
01:58:26,040 --> 01:58:27,500
Hey, come on, let's run!

2216
01:58:27,840 --> 01:58:29,670
Sorry, uncle, we dropped it.

2217
01:59:03,710 --> 01:59:09,920
Keerthi! Keerthi! Keerthi!

2218
01:59:15,380 --> 01:59:16,760
Action!

2219
01:59:29,790 --> 01:59:31,580
Hold on! Who are you?
What do you want?

2220
01:59:33,340 --> 01:59:35,550
-My wife is here.
-It's a women's training center.

2221
01:59:35,630 --> 01:59:37,210
-I want to meet my wife.
-Men are not allowed.

2222
01:59:37,290 --> 01:59:38,580
Please tell the manager I'm here.

2223
01:59:38,670 --> 01:59:39,590
You can check with him.

2224
01:59:39,750 --> 01:59:42,080
-Any problem?
-My wife Keerthi is inside.

2225
01:59:42,210 --> 01:59:44,170
I want to meet her.
He is not allowing me.

2226
01:59:45,040 --> 01:59:46,540
Oh, so you're Keerthi's husband.

2227
01:59:46,710 --> 01:59:47,630
Yes, sir.

2228
01:59:48,040 --> 01:59:50,620
-Stay right here. I'll inform Keerthi.
-Okay, sir.

2229
02:00:16,590 --> 02:00:18,380
What did she say? May I come in?

2230
02:00:21,040 --> 02:00:22,620
Keerthi is not interested in meeting you.

2231
02:00:23,460 --> 02:00:26,420
She said, "If you're man enough, 
fight it out in the arena."

2232
02:00:28,630 --> 02:00:29,510
You may leave!

2233
02:00:43,210 --> 02:00:45,670
Keerthi, come on, get up.
Let's start the practice.

2234
02:00:45,750 --> 02:00:47,250
Practice? That too now?

2235
02:00:47,540 --> 02:00:49,210
No chance! I cannot!

2236
02:00:49,290 --> 02:00:50,210
I'm so tired!

2237
02:00:50,340 --> 02:00:51,840
At least we can go jogging.

2238
02:00:52,540 --> 02:00:53,920
Oh, no!

2239
02:00:54,040 --> 02:00:56,250
For God's sake, spare me.
I'm going home.

2240
02:00:57,000 --> 02:00:57,960
Okay!

2241
02:01:04,840 --> 02:01:05,840
Coach!

2242
02:01:07,420 --> 02:01:08,420
Who was it?

2243
02:01:16,840 --> 02:01:18,550
Submission wrestling is organized

2244
02:01:18,750 --> 02:01:20,540
by Palakkad Wrestling Association.

2245
02:01:20,630 --> 02:01:22,300
Everyone is invited to watch.

2246
02:01:22,380 --> 02:01:23,880
In the upcoming submission wrestling, 

2247
02:01:24,000 --> 02:01:26,580
a man and his wife are about
to fight each other.

2248
02:01:26,750 --> 02:01:28,960
What's your opinion
on the Veera-Keerthi wrestling match?

2249
02:01:29,090 --> 02:01:30,670
It's an evil world. I have nothing to say.

2250
02:01:30,840 --> 02:01:33,420
-Your opinion?
-Life is wrestling itself.

2251
02:01:33,790 --> 02:01:36,790
Veera is the only man who is fighting
for men's liberation.

2252
02:01:36,920 --> 02:01:40,840
We have taken an oath
to go on a pilgrimage and shave our heads.

2253
02:01:40,920 --> 02:01:42,250
-What do you say, guys?
-Yes!

2254
02:01:42,340 --> 02:01:45,090
It does not matter whether it is a man
or a woman. The best one should win.

2255
02:01:45,170 --> 02:01:47,170
Women who fight for equal rights, ask them

2256
02:01:47,340 --> 02:01:48,510
to take part in the competition.

2257
02:01:48,630 --> 02:01:51,050
How long do wives abide by their husbands?
Bring it on!

2258
02:01:51,420 --> 02:01:53,340
The women have started to strike back.

2259
02:01:53,420 --> 02:01:55,550
It's high time patriarchy ends.

2260
02:01:55,710 --> 02:01:58,210
You may speak all you want.
But men are above anything.

2261
02:01:58,420 --> 02:02:01,800
Then let's witness the rest
at the stadium.

2262
02:02:02,000 --> 02:02:03,380
-It's very interesting news.
-Okay.

2263
02:02:03,460 --> 02:02:04,540
We are waiting. Let's enjoy!

2264
02:02:04,630 --> 02:02:07,260
People eagerly wait to see who wins

2265
02:02:07,380 --> 02:02:09,210
the match between man and wife.

2266
02:02:09,340 --> 02:02:10,470
The girl will win!

2267
02:02:10,630 --> 02:02:12,010
The girl will win for sure.

2268
02:02:12,170 --> 02:02:13,050
Veera will win!

2269
02:02:13,250 --> 02:02:15,080
Keerthi!

2270
02:02:15,250 --> 02:02:16,630
We are Keerthi Army!

2271
02:02:17,040 --> 02:02:21,420
Submission wrestling
is a 100-year-old tradition in Kerala.

2272
02:02:21,540 --> 02:02:25,460
This competition is
in the honor of Kerala.

2273
02:02:25,630 --> 02:02:27,590
It's the game of the people!

2274
02:02:27,710 --> 02:02:31,670
The competition we all have been
waiting for

2275
02:02:31,750 --> 02:02:34,670
Is about to begin in a while.

2276
02:02:34,920 --> 02:02:36,630
Come on clap!

2277
02:02:36,960 --> 02:02:41,840
On behalf of our academy, 
we invite you all.

2278
02:02:42,040 --> 02:02:45,080
More than fifty wrestlers are about to

2279
02:02:45,210 --> 02:02:47,710
take part in 36 competitions.

2280
02:02:47,790 --> 02:02:49,750
Ultimately, a wife and a husband

2281
02:02:49,840 --> 02:02:51,760
will compete under a special category.

2282
02:02:51,920 --> 02:02:54,170
The first round is about to begin.

2283
02:02:55,750 --> 02:03:00,710
Wrestler Unni has thrown a stronghold
in the beginning.

2284
02:03:00,880 --> 02:03:02,960
The opponent bites the dust.

2285
02:03:03,130 --> 02:03:08,460
Kannur Veerangai from Trivandrum
is trying to slam Lakshmi.

2286
02:03:08,630 --> 02:03:10,760
She won the match!

2287
02:03:14,500 --> 02:03:16,330
Wow! An Unbelievable

2288
02:03:16,420 --> 02:03:18,800
and unexpected attack from Sreejith.

2289
02:03:22,000 --> 02:03:23,130
Is it Marimuthu?

2290
02:03:23,210 --> 02:03:25,130
Yeah, we're at the council office.

2291
02:03:25,210 --> 02:03:27,500
My nephew's match is about to begin.
Hurry up!

2292
02:03:27,670 --> 02:03:29,170
What a performance, Veena!

2293
02:03:29,250 --> 02:03:30,630
Veena's efforts didn't go to waste.

2294
02:03:30,880 --> 02:03:33,090
She's celebrating her victory.

2295
02:03:34,250 --> 02:03:37,380
Wow, Gopi just slammed Sarath
to the ground.

2296
02:03:40,840 --> 02:03:43,760
Palakkad Keda Kumar unexpectedly

2297
02:03:43,840 --> 02:03:46,970
lost to Ernakulam Suresh!

2298
02:03:48,670 --> 02:03:50,750
One of the important matches

2299
02:03:50,840 --> 02:03:53,380
of this tournament is on.

2300
02:03:53,710 --> 02:03:56,590
Wow, what a throw! Amazing throw!

2301
02:03:58,040 --> 02:03:59,040
Sir!

2302
02:03:59,500 --> 02:04:00,920
As a wrestling coach, 

2303
02:04:01,000 --> 02:04:02,710
who do you think will win?
Veera or Keerthi?

2304
02:04:03,000 --> 02:04:04,080
No doubt about it.

2305
02:04:04,670 --> 02:04:05,590
Keerthi will be the winner.

2306
02:04:06,340 --> 02:04:07,760
Veera is going to get beaten to death.

2307
02:04:08,130 --> 02:04:09,920
The media is just hyping him up.

2308
02:04:10,210 --> 02:04:11,670
He is not worth it.

2309
02:04:17,250 --> 02:04:18,130
Keerthi.

2310
02:04:19,210 --> 02:04:20,090
Keerthi.

2311
02:04:25,170 --> 02:04:26,090
Are you okay?

2312
02:04:28,630 --> 02:04:31,590
Are you wondering how
to compete with your husband?

2313
02:04:32,340 --> 02:04:34,260
It was not your decision.

2314
02:04:35,460 --> 02:04:39,170
He voluntarily asked
to arrange this match.

2315
02:04:41,670 --> 02:04:44,880
You have
to knock him down in the first round.

2316
02:04:45,340 --> 02:04:47,380
Don't worry. I'm there for you.

2317
02:04:49,880 --> 02:04:50,710
Take your hands off.

2318
02:04:52,210 --> 02:04:53,460
I said, take your hands off!

2319
02:04:53,670 --> 02:04:54,590
What?

2320
02:04:55,880 --> 02:04:57,340
Hey, come on, Keerthi!

2321
02:05:00,420 --> 02:05:01,880
Players have complained about you.

2322
02:05:02,210 --> 02:05:03,790
For the way you treat women.

2323
02:05:04,040 --> 02:05:05,080
Get lost!

2324
02:05:06,340 --> 02:05:07,420
Get lost!

2325
02:05:18,420 --> 02:05:20,670
I just received the report.
What could I do?

2326
02:05:22,880 --> 02:05:23,760
Any problem?

2327
02:05:28,710 --> 02:05:29,590
Keerthi is pregnant.

2328
02:05:35,000 --> 02:05:37,500
During the fitness check before the match, 

2329
02:05:37,590 --> 02:05:40,010
Mrs. Keerthi tested positive
for pregnancy.

2330
02:05:40,750 --> 02:05:42,670
-Is Keerthi aware of it?
-No!

2331
02:05:46,750 --> 02:05:47,750
What are you going to do?

2332
02:05:48,090 --> 02:05:50,260
What else?
We have to cancel the match.

2333
02:05:53,000 --> 02:05:54,250
Let's not cancel the match.

2334
02:05:54,960 --> 02:05:56,500
As per the plan, 
let us proceed with the match.

2335
02:05:57,420 --> 02:05:59,500
How? What if something goes wrong?

2336
02:06:02,340 --> 02:06:03,880
There is no other option.

2337
02:06:04,040 --> 02:06:05,000
The show must go on!

2338
02:06:05,920 --> 02:06:08,000
Let's not do it, sir.
Due to strain during the match, 

2339
02:06:08,130 --> 02:06:09,590
there are chances of abortion.

2340
02:06:10,460 --> 02:06:13,590
If this match is canceled, 
we'll lose millions.

2341
02:06:15,170 --> 02:06:17,670
Who will answer the audience?

2342
02:06:18,290 --> 02:06:20,370
Who will answer the sponsors?

2343
02:06:20,920 --> 02:06:21,840
Would you answer them?

2344
02:06:22,040 --> 02:06:23,710
Sir, you're talking about business.

2345
02:06:23,920 --> 02:06:25,460
But I'm talking about life.

2346
02:06:26,340 --> 02:06:29,050
The husband and wife are going to fight
and go their separate ways.

2347
02:06:29,420 --> 02:06:31,380
It does not matter if something
goes wrong with the child.

2348
02:06:31,750 --> 02:06:34,000
I will take responsibility for everything.

2349
02:06:34,290 --> 02:06:35,580
As long as you stay silent, we're good.

2350
02:06:35,790 --> 02:06:37,870
-I can't stay silent--
-Hey, don't you understand?

2351
02:06:38,380 --> 02:06:39,840
Stop with your nonsense.

2352
02:06:41,670 --> 02:06:42,590
Let's go!

2353
02:06:50,670 --> 02:06:53,170
The most anticipated fight of all, 

2354
02:06:53,380 --> 02:06:57,800
the Veera-Keerthi wrestling match
is about to begin.

2355
02:06:58,090 --> 02:07:02,800
Even in the Olympics, we don't get
to witness a match of this kind.

2356
02:07:03,040 --> 02:07:06,080
Husband vs. wife in the same arena!

2357
02:07:10,460 --> 02:07:14,880
The wrestling
that was happening within four walls

2358
02:07:15,210 --> 02:07:17,460
has moved to the arena now!

2359
02:07:31,340 --> 02:07:32,630
Come on, fight!

2360
02:07:44,590 --> 02:07:45,760
Come on, ready!

2361
02:07:50,250 --> 02:07:51,540
Contact! Contact!

2362
02:07:53,710 --> 02:07:54,840
Come on, Veera!

2363
02:07:58,040 --> 02:07:59,330
Hold tight! Don't let go!

2364
02:07:59,920 --> 02:08:00,800
Hey!

2365
02:08:16,590 --> 02:08:18,300
Step away! Step away!

2366
02:08:24,170 --> 02:08:25,090
Keerthi!

2367
02:08:25,250 --> 02:08:26,830
-Hey, step away!
-Keerthi!

2368
02:08:27,540 --> 02:08:29,960
-I said, step away.
-Keerthi, what happened?

2369
02:08:30,170 --> 02:08:31,250
-Keerthi!
-Keerthi!

2370
02:08:32,130 --> 02:08:33,050
I told you!

2371
02:08:35,210 --> 02:08:37,250
Come on, hurry up. Take her away.

2372
02:08:37,460 --> 02:08:39,670
She fainted.
What will happen now?

2373
02:08:42,590 --> 02:08:44,220
Hurry up!
Take her inside the ambulance.

2374
02:08:44,380 --> 02:08:46,760
-Come on, hurry up!
-Be careful!

2375
02:08:48,960 --> 02:08:50,880
-Where are you going?
-Hey, get down from the ambulance.

2376
02:08:51,000 --> 02:08:52,920
-Why are you getting inside?
-She's my wife!

2377
02:08:53,000 --> 02:08:54,540
-Hey, pull him down.
-Hey, she's my wife!

2378
02:08:54,630 --> 02:08:56,670
-I need to go to the hospital.
-Please hear me out!

2379
02:08:56,880 --> 02:08:59,090
What the hell is wrong with you people?
Sattam, please tell them.

2380
02:08:59,170 --> 02:09:01,380
Have you guys lost your mind?
I need to go to the hospital.

2381
02:09:01,460 --> 02:09:03,000
Let go of me! I said, let go of me!

2382
02:09:03,920 --> 02:09:05,960
Doctors will take care of her.
You go and play the match.

2383
02:09:06,170 --> 02:09:07,130
Are you kidding?

2384
02:09:07,290 --> 02:09:08,710
I came here only
to compete with my wife.

2385
02:09:08,790 --> 02:09:11,210
I don't know what happened to her.
And you want me to play the match.

2386
02:09:11,460 --> 02:09:14,290
It'll become a big issue
if the match does not go on.

2387
02:09:14,840 --> 02:09:18,170
As per committee rules, 
you will have to face another wrestler.

2388
02:09:21,750 --> 02:09:23,290
I can't compete with this girl.

2389
02:09:23,670 --> 02:09:25,170
We are not asking you to fight a man.

2390
02:09:25,420 --> 02:09:26,840
We are asking you to fight a woman.

2391
02:09:27,170 --> 02:09:30,750
Are you afraid to lose to a girl?

2392
02:09:31,040 --> 02:09:33,250
Humiliation is not a new thing to you.

2393
02:09:33,590 --> 02:09:34,510
So, go on!

2394
02:09:36,210 --> 02:09:39,420
It wasn't bright of me to compete
against my wife.

2395
02:09:39,670 --> 02:09:42,130
That does not mean
I'll fight any woman in the town.

2396
02:09:42,290 --> 02:09:44,540
If I must play a match, 

2397
02:09:44,630 --> 02:09:45,760
I'll fight you.

2398
02:09:46,090 --> 02:09:47,340
If you're a man, fight me!

2399
02:09:49,290 --> 02:09:51,580
Hey, Veera, have you lost your mind?

2400
02:09:51,960 --> 02:09:54,170
He's a champion coach.
And you want to fight him?

2401
02:09:54,340 --> 02:09:56,550
I don't care.
He's talking too much, Sattam.

2402
02:09:56,670 --> 02:09:58,590
He'll pipe down
if I punch him in the face.

2403
02:09:59,250 --> 02:10:00,380
Do you know who he is?

2404
02:10:00,880 --> 02:10:02,960
During a match in Delhi, 
his punch killed his opponent.

2405
02:10:03,170 --> 02:10:04,420
And you're challenging him to a match.

2406
02:10:04,750 --> 02:10:06,380
Sir, I care less about his performance.

2407
02:10:06,920 --> 02:10:08,210
I don't know what happened to my wife.

2408
02:10:08,500 --> 02:10:09,750
He's not letting me go to the hospital.

2409
02:10:09,840 --> 02:10:11,590
He's gone mad lamenting about rules.

2410
02:10:11,710 --> 02:10:13,540
I'm ready to fight, only if it's him.

2411
02:10:13,750 --> 02:10:15,170
If not, I will leave right away.

2412
02:10:17,750 --> 02:10:21,420
I can't help it
if you have a death wish.

2413
02:10:22,460 --> 02:10:23,340
Come on!

2414
02:10:33,090 --> 02:10:34,010
Veera!

2415
02:10:35,670 --> 02:10:36,550
Veera!

2416
02:10:38,170 --> 02:10:39,050
Here he comes!

2417
02:10:40,710 --> 02:10:41,630
Veera!

2418
02:10:48,540 --> 02:10:49,420
Action!

2419
02:10:56,630 --> 02:10:58,300
Up! Up! Up! Come on!

2420
02:11:02,880 --> 02:11:03,800
Come on!

2421
02:11:06,090 --> 02:11:07,010
Come on!

2422
02:11:33,540 --> 02:11:34,750
Come on! Come on!

2423
02:11:35,130 --> 02:11:36,170
Hey!

2424
02:11:40,880 --> 02:11:41,840
Hit him back!

2425
02:12:00,040 --> 02:12:01,580
That's it! Come on, Veera!

2426
02:12:22,420 --> 02:12:24,170
Hey, what the hell are you doing?

2427
02:12:24,380 --> 02:12:25,590
Come on, get up!

2428
02:12:26,250 --> 02:12:27,170
-Oh!
-Hey!

2429
02:12:27,750 --> 02:12:30,170
You can't play foul. Step out!

2430
02:12:30,250 --> 02:12:31,500
Hey, what the hell?

2431
02:12:31,590 --> 02:12:32,550
-Sir, sir, sir!
-Hey!

2432
02:12:33,040 --> 02:12:34,080
Hey!

2433
02:12:54,500 --> 02:12:56,880
He stepped out of the ring.
Foul! Foul!

2434
02:13:04,590 --> 02:13:06,670
Shall I tell you a secret?

2435
02:13:07,670 --> 02:13:11,750
Usually, a wife conveys this secret
to the husband.

2436
02:13:12,290 --> 02:13:14,370
Unfortunately, your wife itself
does not know the secret.

2437
02:13:14,840 --> 02:13:15,920
Let me tell you the secret.

2438
02:13:17,090 --> 02:13:18,800
You're going to be a father.

2439
02:13:21,920 --> 02:13:23,210
Hey! Hey!

2440
02:13:31,130 --> 02:13:32,630
Keerthi is pregnant.

2441
02:13:32,920 --> 02:13:34,840
That is why she fainted.

2442
02:13:36,000 --> 02:13:40,080
I didn't care for her pregnancy
and made her compete.

2443
02:13:42,290 --> 02:13:45,290
But your child is blessed with long life.

2444
02:13:46,500 --> 02:13:47,500
It escaped.

2445
02:13:48,790 --> 02:13:51,500
If not, you would have killed your child--

2446
02:14:00,170 --> 02:14:02,750
-Go, Veera!
-Slam that man!

2447
02:14:02,960 --> 02:14:05,500
Come on! Slam him!

2448
02:14:13,420 --> 02:14:15,050
Veera! Veera!

2449
02:14:15,250 --> 02:14:16,380
Veera!

2450
02:14:17,090 --> 02:14:17,970
Here he comes!

2451
02:14:18,710 --> 02:14:19,790
Veera!

2452
02:14:19,960 --> 02:14:21,130
Here he comes!

2453
02:14:22,000 --> 02:14:23,630
Veera, you nailed it.

2454
02:14:23,840 --> 02:14:24,720
Bring it on!

2455
02:14:32,170 --> 02:14:34,590
That's it. That's it.
Pin him down!

2456
02:14:36,000 --> 02:14:37,790
Don't let go. Pin him down!

2457
02:14:49,670 --> 02:14:51,340
Awesome!

2458
02:14:51,630 --> 02:14:53,590
Doctor, he's fighting dirty.

2459
02:14:53,790 --> 02:14:56,170
Forget it, sir.
The audience is enjoying the fight.

2460
02:14:56,290 --> 02:14:57,460
That's what we want.

2461
02:15:09,920 --> 02:15:10,920
Super!

2462
02:15:23,590 --> 02:15:25,470
Awesome! Wow!

2463
02:15:43,960 --> 02:15:45,500
Let go of him!

2464
02:15:45,750 --> 02:15:46,670
Let go!

2465
02:15:46,960 --> 02:15:48,170
Let go of him, Veera!

2466
02:15:52,840 --> 02:15:53,880
Let go!

2467
02:15:54,090 --> 02:15:55,300
Let go of me!

2468
02:15:58,000 --> 02:15:59,000
-Let go.
-I won't!

2469
02:16:06,210 --> 02:16:07,540
Hey! Hey! Hey!

2470
02:16:11,250 --> 02:16:14,330
Lokesh is down.
What a performance by Veera.

2471
02:16:14,500 --> 02:16:16,170
Unbelievable attack!

2472
02:16:16,460 --> 02:16:18,590
What a man! He's stubborn!

2473
02:16:19,290 --> 02:16:23,750
-Unexpectedly, Veera emerged as a winner.
-That's my boy!

2474
02:16:23,880 --> 02:16:26,090
Veera, you're a champion!

2475
02:16:26,920 --> 02:16:28,380
To whom do you dedicate this victory?

2476
02:16:31,000 --> 02:16:32,629
I dedicate this victory
to my wife, Keerthi.

2477
02:16:32,790 --> 02:16:34,670
You came here to compete
with your wife.

2478
02:16:34,750 --> 02:16:37,629
What is the reason you're dedicating it
to your wife?

2479
02:16:37,959 --> 02:16:41,290
I did not come to compete
or win against Keerthi.

2480
02:16:41,420 --> 02:16:43,379
I came to know a few things
about Keerthi.

2481
02:16:43,670 --> 02:16:46,799
I came down to convince her
and take her back home.

2482
02:16:47,040 --> 02:16:49,370
I wanted to convey that women
are nothing less than a man.

2483
02:16:49,629 --> 02:16:51,010
That's why I did not care
if I won or lost.

2484
02:16:51,170 --> 02:16:53,420
I wanted to prove to the world
through this match, 

2485
02:16:53,920 --> 02:16:56,459
that in life, some of us will take time
to understand a few things.

2486
02:16:57,040 --> 02:16:58,420
I understood just now.

2487
02:16:59,129 --> 02:17:02,629
Until yesterday, I believed
men were above women.

2488
02:17:03,090 --> 02:17:05,510
Keerthi proved me wrong.

2489
02:17:05,959 --> 02:17:09,250
I thought wrestling was easy
as it is played on the sand.

2490
02:17:09,379 --> 02:17:10,379
And went to train.

2491
02:17:10,629 --> 02:17:12,129
Had I not taken the training, 

2492
02:17:12,250 --> 02:17:15,040
I would've not known the struggle
Keerthi went through.

2493
02:17:15,500 --> 02:17:17,330
I trained only for fifteen days.

2494
02:17:17,540 --> 02:17:18,670
I could not take it.

2495
02:17:19,040 --> 02:17:20,459
My whole body was in pain.

2496
02:17:21,250 --> 02:17:24,420
But a girl has been doing it
for fifteen years.

2497
02:17:24,840 --> 02:17:26,420
I can't imagine the pain she went through.

2498
02:17:30,590 --> 02:17:32,469
Sports and India are far apart.

2499
02:17:32,629 --> 02:17:35,799
Here, even the boys get told to study

2500
02:17:36,420 --> 02:17:38,090
rather than play sports, let alone girls.

2501
02:17:38,290 --> 02:17:41,120
Girls who overcome obstacles
to play sports are forced to get married

2502
02:17:41,590 --> 02:17:45,590
and suppress their dreams and goals.

2503
02:17:45,920 --> 02:17:49,670
They get lectured on life and family.

2504
02:17:50,129 --> 02:17:52,510
If given proper training
and family support, 

2505
02:17:52,709 --> 02:17:56,920
a million girls in India will win
the Olympic gold medal.

2506
02:17:57,590 --> 02:17:59,879
One gold among the million is Keerthi.

2507
02:18:02,129 --> 02:18:05,670
All this while, 
I did not recognize her worth.

2508
02:18:07,290 --> 02:18:10,670
So, I apologize to my gold
in front of you people.

2509
02:18:12,959 --> 02:18:14,129
Please forgive me, Keerthi.

2510
02:18:15,250 --> 02:18:19,459
Your husband won over you
without competing with you.

2511
02:18:27,459 --> 02:18:28,420
Keerthi…

2512
02:18:31,170 --> 02:18:32,209
Hello, what are you doing?

2513
02:18:32,290 --> 02:18:34,000
Can't you see?
I'm putting her on a drip.

2514
02:18:34,129 --> 02:18:35,799
My wife doesn't need it!

2515
02:18:35,879 --> 02:18:37,549
Do you know who she is?
A wrestler!

2516
02:18:38,290 --> 02:18:41,080
Keerthi, if we don't leave, 
they'll pile on the bill with the drip.

2517
02:18:41,209 --> 02:18:42,040
Come on, let's go.

2518
02:18:42,379 --> 02:18:45,760
You sent a divorce notice.
How could you even face her?

2519
02:18:45,840 --> 02:18:47,840
She won't go with you.
Please leave.

2520
02:18:48,540 --> 02:18:51,290
Dear, why would you
tell the nurse about our affairs?

2521
02:18:52,340 --> 02:18:54,590
You need not put her on a drip.
Please leave.

2522
02:18:54,790 --> 02:18:57,170
-Go on. Leave.
-Sir!

2523
02:18:59,629 --> 02:19:03,670
My stupid uncle and the lawyer sent
the divorce notice without my knowledge.

2524
02:19:04,040 --> 02:19:05,250
Tear it up and throw it away!

2525
02:19:05,920 --> 02:19:06,840
Let's go.

2526
02:19:09,090 --> 02:19:11,719
I had a dream
to make it big in this sport.

2527
02:19:12,629 --> 02:19:13,709
I couldn't make it.

2528
02:19:14,209 --> 02:19:17,420
But I wish for my child
to play for this country.

2529
02:19:18,500 --> 02:19:20,790
That won't happen if I stay
with you. So, please leave.

2530
02:19:22,040 --> 02:19:23,830
Why do you think you couldn't make it?

2531
02:19:24,040 --> 02:19:25,209
It's not like you're old.

2532
02:19:25,340 --> 02:19:26,799
Marikann played even after having a child.

2533
02:19:26,879 --> 02:19:28,260
She also won a medal for the country.

2534
02:19:28,420 --> 02:19:29,750
In fact, she had three children.

2535
02:19:31,590 --> 02:19:32,590
Marikann?

2536
02:19:33,000 --> 02:19:35,420
The boxer.
They even made a film about her.

2537
02:19:36,920 --> 02:19:37,959
Do you mean Mary Kom?

2538
02:19:38,250 --> 02:19:41,000
Be it Mary or Mari, 
all I'm saying is you can do it too.

2539
02:19:41,129 --> 02:19:42,209
I will help you win.

2540
02:19:44,790 --> 02:19:46,959
-Are you sure?
-I swear I will.

2541
02:19:47,290 --> 02:19:50,000
It's enough if you
compete with the opponents.

2542
02:19:50,170 --> 02:19:51,460
You need not compete
with the family anymore.

2543
02:19:56,630 --> 02:19:58,130
You won't go back on your word, right?

2544
02:19:59,590 --> 02:20:00,840
I swear on our child I won't.

2545
02:20:10,670 --> 02:20:14,960
Keerthi! Keerthi! Keerthi!

2546
02:20:32,380 --> 02:20:34,800
Hey, clap for your mom!
